WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.416 --> 00:00:03.066
Unit twenty-two. Asking for Help!

2
00:00:03.994 --> 00:00:08.051
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:08.101 --> 00:00:11.242
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.292 --> 00:00:14.567
Today we learn about Asking for Help. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.285 --> 00:00:18.285
Help. Say it with me. Help!

6
00:00:21.762 --> 00:00:25.462
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

7
00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:32.312
Counselor. Say it with me. Counselor!

8
00:00:35.837 --> 00:00:39.171
Feelings. Say it with me. Feelings!

9
00:00:42.652 --> 00:00:46.652
Warning signs. Say it with me. Warning signs!

10
00:00:50.141 --> 00:00:53.058
Talk. Say it with me. Talk!

11
00:00:56.554 --> 00:00:59.821
Strength. Say it with me. Strength!

12
00:01:03.362 --> 00:01:06.446
Support. Say it with me. Support!

13
00:01:09.954 --> 00:01:18.316
Asking for help is a sign of strength. A trusted adult or school counselor can listen to feelings and give support. Talk early when you notice warning signs.

14
00:01:18.366 --> 00:01:21.041
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:22.452 --> 00:01:27.407
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.457 --> 00:01:28.608
Counselor!

17
00:01:29.374 --> 00:01:34.459
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.509 --> 00:01:35.659
Strength!

19
00:01:36.566 --> 00:01:42.228
Did you know? Most mental health problems are easier to manage when people get help early!

20
00:01:42.278 --> 00:01:44.100
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.824 --> 00:01:52.337
Think and answer. Who at school could you talk to about a problem?

22
00:01:52.387 --> 00:01:53.537
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.537 --> 00:01:59.517
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:02.313
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

